e-db/issues/events/5395727917","actor":{"login":"rthallamko3","id":17170123,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MTcwMTIz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17170123?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3","html_url":"https://github.com/rthallamko3","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"subscribed","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2021-10-01T17:04:50Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/comments/933656064","html_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/10162#issuecomment-933656064","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/10162","id":933656064,"node_id":"IC_kwDOBlCVUc43pnYA","user":{"login":"robertsami","id":1457684,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NTc2ODQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1457684?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertsami","html_url":"https://github.com/robertsami","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertsami/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertsami/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertsami/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertsami/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertsami/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertsami/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertsami/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertsami/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertsami/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-10-04T16:35:22Z","updated_at":"2021-10-04T16:35:22Z","body":"@rthallamko3 passing back to you, with some notes about one specific problematic situation to consider:\r\n\r\n1. client issues \"commit\" of a large transaction to coordinator\r\n2. coordinator asynchronously issues TransactionStatus::APPLYING operation to involved tablets\r\n2. participating tablet calls `Tablet::ApplyIntents` which calls `PrepareApplyIntentsBatch`\r\n3. `PrepareApplyIntentsBatch` finds that it needs to prepare more than `FLAGS_txn_max_apply_batch_records` for this transaction https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/blob/master/src/yb/docdb/docdb.cc#L1257\r\n4. docdb applies the current batch of intents to regular_db along with a special `ApplyTransactionStatePB` record which tracks apply progress\r\n5. background `ApplyIntentsTask` is registered to write a new batch of intents every `FLAGS_apply_intents_task_injected_delay_ms` millis\r\n\r\nif we've applied some but not all batches of a transaction, and then we split a tablet, the post split compaction will wipe `ApplyTransactionStatePB` records. in practice, when a tablet is bootstrapped, we should eventually register `ApplyIntentsTask` instances for each incomplete `ApplyTransactionStatePB` found in the bootstrapped regular_db_ (see `TransactionParticipant::LoadFinished` which is called by `TransactionLoader`). so i think one way we see this issue cause data loss is if:\r\n1. on tablet split, we bootstrap the new tablet and register a new`ApplyIntentsTask` for the ongoing transaction on the child subtablet\r\n2. post split compaction runs and wipes the `ApplyTransactionStatePB` from `regular_db_`\r\n3. before the ongoing transaction is complete, the node crashes\r\n4. on subsequent bootstrap of this tablet, we will *not* find a `ApplyTransactionStatePB` for the previously ongoing transaction since it has been compacted away, and we will incorrectly fail to apply the remaining transaction's intents","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/comments/933656064/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"robertsami","id":1457684,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NTc2ODQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1457684?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertsami","html_url":"https://github.com/robertsami","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertsami/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertsami/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertsami/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertsami/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertsami/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertsami/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertsami/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertsami/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertsami/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":5405272458,"node_id":"MEE_lADOBlCVUc48aTz_zwAAAAFCLemK","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/events/5405272458","actor":{"login":"rthallamko3","id":17170123,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MTcwMTIz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17170123?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3","html_url":